---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_URL } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How DAX Guide collects, uses, and protects your data, including cookies, Google AdSense, and Google Analytics."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <div class="content-width">
      <span class="page-eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: July 19, 2026</p>

      <p>
        DAX Guide ("we", "us", or "our") operates {SITE_URL} (the "Site").
        This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use
        it, and the choices you have. By using the Site, you agree to the
        practices described here.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you provide</h3>
      <p>
        When you contact us via our contact form or email, we collect the
        name, email address, and message content you voluntarily provide.
        We use this solely to respond to your inquiry.
      </p>
      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        Like most websites, we and our third-party partners collect
        certain technical information automatically when you visit the
        Site, including: IP address, browser type and version, device
        type, referring URL, pages visited, time spent on pages, and
        approximate geographic location (country/region level).
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies and similar technologies to operate the Site,
        analyze traffic, and serve advertising. You can control cookies
        through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect
        Site functionality.
      </p>
      <p>Categories of cookies we use:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential</strong> — required for the Site to function.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics</strong> — help us understand how visitors use the Site (Google Analytics).</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising</strong> — used by Google AdSense to serve and measure ads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Google AdSense and the DoubleClick Cookie</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google, as a
        third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior
        visits to this and other websites.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        <li>You may also opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        <li>For more information about how Google uses data when you use our site, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy for partner sites</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics to understand Site usage. Google Analytics
        collects information anonymously and in aggregate. We use this data
        to improve content and Site performance. See
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>
        for details.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site</li>
        <li>To analyze usage trends and measure advertising performance</li>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and feedback</li>
        <li>To detect, prevent, and address technical issues or abuse</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We engage the following third-party services that may process limited data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising (Google LLC)</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — web analytics (Google LLC)</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — content delivery and security</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain contact-form messages for up to 12 months. Analytics data
        is retained according to Google's default retention settings.
        Advertising data is governed by the respective ad partner's policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your jurisdiction (e.g., GDPR, CCPA), you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to or restrict certain processing</li>
        <li>Opt out of personalized advertising</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent (where processing is consent-based)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise these rights, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>. We
        respond to verified requests within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not
        knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe
        a child has provided us information, please contact us and we will
        delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes are
        effective when posted on this page. We will update the "Last
        updated" date above accordingly.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Privacy Policy? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>
        or email <a href="mailto:privacy@powerbitutorials.com">privacy@powerbitutorials.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 56px 0 80px; }
  .page-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-page h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .updated { color: var(--c-text-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .legal-page h2 { margin-top: 2.2em; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .legal-page h3 { margin-top: 1.4em; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--c-text); }
  .legal-page p { font-size: 0.95rem; }
</style>
